msgid "Install Klein and build your first bounded and streaming data pipelines."
msgstr "安装 Klein，并构建第一个有界和流式数据管道。"

msgid "Get started with Klein"
msgstr "Klein 快速入门"

msgid ""
"This guide creates an explicit `Pipeline`, runs a bounded `DataStream`, "
"and shows how to submit a long-running dataflow."
msgstr "本指南将创建一个显式 `Pipeline`、运行有界 `DataStream`，并演示如何提交长时间运行的数据流。"

msgid "Install Klein"
msgstr "安装 Klein"

msgid ""
"Create an isolated Python environment and install the current source "
"checkout:"
msgstr "创建隔离的 Python 环境并安装当前源码检出："

msgid ""
"Kafka, Iceberg, RocketMQ, Redis, RocksDB, and Serve are optional "
"integrations. Install only the extra required by the application, for "
"example `ray-klein[kafka]`, `ray-klein[iceberg]`, `ray-klein[rocketmq]`, "
"`ray-klein[redis]`, `ray-klein[rocksdb]`, or `ray-klein[serve]`. Use "
"`ray-klein[all]` for an integration development environment. RocketMQ "
"also requires the native `librocketmq` runtime on every worker."
msgstr ""
"Kafka、Iceberg、RocketMQ、Redis、RocksDB 和 Serve 均为可选集成。请只安装应用所需的额外依赖，例如 "
"`ray-klein[kafka]`、`ray-klein[iceberg]`、`ray-klein[rocketmq]`、`ray-"
"klein[redis]`、`ray-klein[rocksdb]` 或 `ray-klein[serve]`。集成开发环境可使用 `ray-"
"klein[all]`。RocketMQ 还要求每个 Worker 都具备原生 `librocketmq` 运行时。"

msgid "Run a bounded pipeline"
msgstr "运行有界管道"

msgid ""
"`klein.pipeline()` isolates one logical job and rejects misspelled Klein "
"configuration keys by default. A single terminal submits itself; "
"`result()` waits for and returns collected rows:"
msgstr ""
"`klein.pipeline()` 隔离一个逻辑作业，并默认拒绝拼错的 Klein 配置键。单个终端会自行提交；`result()` "
"会等待并返回收集的记录："

msgid "The completed job handle returns these rows:"
msgstr "已完成的作业句柄会返回以下行："

msgid ""
"Klein keeps transformations lazy until `collect()` creates and submits "
"the single terminal. Batch execution lowers the graph to Ray Data. The "
"module-level `klein.read_*` and `klein.from_*` builders plus "
"`klein.execute()` remain available for applications that prefer one "
"implicit, deferred pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Klein 会让转换保持惰性，直到 `collect()` 创建并提交单个终端。批处理执行会将图下沉到 Ray "
"Data。偏好单个隐式延迟管道的应用仍可使用模块级 `klein.read_*`、`klein.from_*` 构建器和 "
"`klein.execute()`。"

msgid "Read data with Ray Data"
msgstr "使用 Ray Data 读取数据"

msgid ""
"Source construction follows `ray.data`. Use the explicit `ray_data` "
"namespace when calling an installed Ray Data reader or Dataset method:"
msgstr ""
"源的构造方式遵循 `ray.data`。调用已安装的 Ray Data reader 或 Dataset 方法时，请使用显式的 "
"`ray_data` 命名空间："

msgid ""
"Klein forwards reader and Dataset arguments to the installed Ray version."
" See [Ray Data interoperability](ray-data-interop.md) for the execution "
"boundary and advanced adapters, or the [connector "
"catalog](connectors/index.md) to choose an input or output and review all"
" of its options."
msgstr ""
"Klein 会将 reader 和 Dataset 参数转发给已安装的 Ray 版本。有关执行边界和高级适配器，请参阅 [Ray Data "
"互操作性](ray-data-interop.md)；也可以通过[连接器目录](connectors/index.md) "
"选择输入或输出并查看其全部选项。"

msgid "Submit a dataflow"
msgstr "提交数据流"

msgid "Use a `StatementSet` when multiple side-effect sinks must share one job:"
msgstr "当多个副作用 sink 必须共享一个作业时，请使用 `StatementSet`："

msgid ""
"`StatementSet.explain()` returns the combined dataflow plan without "
"submitting it. `StatementSet.execute()` submits every added sink as one "
"job. Calling a single `write_*()` outside a statement set submits that "
"sink directly."
msgstr ""
"`StatementSet.explain()` 返回组合后的数据流计划，但不会提交。`StatementSet.execute()` "
"将所有已添加的 sink 作为一个作业提交。在 statement set 外调用单个 `write_*()` 会直接提交该 sink。"

msgid ""
"Bounded sources complete after producing all records. Streaming sources, "
"such as Kafka or a custom `SourceFunction`, keep the job active until you"
" stop it or the source terminates."
msgstr "有界源生成全部记录后便会完成。Kafka 或自定义 `SourceFunction` 等流式源会让作业保持活动，直到用户将其停止或源终止。"

msgid ""
"With `value_format=\"json\"`, the source decodes each UTF-8 JSON object "
"value. The default `raw` format emits the same byte schema as "
"`ray.data.read_kafka`. The source discovers new partitions while running,"
" marks empty inputs idle for watermark progress, and resumes from the "
"next offsets stored in the latest checkpoint. For bounded jobs, "
"`write_kafka` uses Ray Data. For streaming jobs, Klein owns a producer "
"per sink subtask and waits for Kafka delivery acknowledgements before "
"advancing checkpoint and replay watermarks. This provides at-least-once "
"delivery: failures can replay a message, so downstream consumers must "
"tolerate duplicates when exactly-once processing is required."
msgstr ""
"使用 `value_format=\"json\"` 时，源会解码每个 UTF-8 JSON 对象值。默认 `raw` 格式发出与 "
"`ray.data.read_kafka` "
"相同的字节模式。源会在运行期间发现新分区，将空输入标记为空闲以推进水位线，并从最新检查点中存储的下一偏移量恢复。对于有界作业，`write_kafka`"
" 使用 Ray Data。对于流式作业，Klein 为每个 sink 子任务持有一个 producer，并在推进检查点和重放水位线前等待 "
"Kafka 交付确认。这提供至少一次交付：故障可能导致消息重放，因此在需要精确一次处理时，下游消费者必须能够容忍重复消息。"

msgid "Configure a pipeline"
msgstr "配置管道"

msgid ""
"Use a mapping, a `key=value` string, typed options, or `RAY_KLEIN_*` "
"environment variables. Explicit code takes precedence over environment "
"values:"
msgstr "可使用映射、`key=value` 字符串、类型化选项或 `RAY_KLEIN_*` 环境变量。代码中的显式配置优先于环境变量值："

msgid ""
"This example selects the optional RocksDB backend; install `.[rocksdb]` "
"first. The dependency-free default is `memory`. Explicit pipelines report"
" unknown keys immediately and suggest close canonical names. The "
"compatibility module-level API can receive the same mapping through "
"`klein.configure()` before source construction."
msgstr ""
"此示例选择可选的 RocksDB 后端，请先安装 `.[rocksdb]`。无额外依赖的默认后端是 `memory`。显式 pipeline "
"会立即报告未知键并建议相近的规范名称；兼容的模块级 API 可在构建数据源前通过 `klein.configure()` 接收同一映射。"

msgid ""
"Use `strict_config=False` only when the mapping intentionally includes "
"application-owned metadata alongside Klein options."
msgstr "仅当映射有意在 Klein 选项之外包含应用自有元数据时，才使用 `strict_config=False`。"

msgid ""
"See [Configure Klein](configuration.md) for precedence and value "
"conversion, then use the [configuration reference](configuration-"
"reference.md) to find every supported key, default, constraint, and "
"environment variable."
msgstr ""
"有关优先级和值转换，请参阅[配置 Klein](configuration.md)；随后可使用[配置参考](configuration-"
"reference.md) 查找所有受支持的键、默认值、约束和环境变量。"

msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

msgid ""
"Read [Key concepts](key-concepts.md) to understand execution, state, "
"event time, and recovery."
msgstr "阅读[核心概念](key-concepts.md)，了解执行、状态、事件时间和恢复。"

msgid ""
"Build the [production streaming walkthrough](production-streaming.md) "
"when you are ready to connect Kafka, watermarks, state, checkpoints, and "
"transactional file output."
msgstr "准备好连接 Kafka、水位线、状态、检查点和事务型文件输出后，请完成[生产环境流处理实战](production-streaming.md)。"

msgid ""
"Check the [operator compatibility matrix](operator-compatibility.md) "
"before mixing Ray Data and native streaming operations."
msgstr "混用 Ray Data 与原生流式操作前，请查看[算子兼容性矩阵](operator-compatibility.md)。"

msgid ""
"Follow the [user guides](user-guides.md) to build stateful pipelines and "
"configure production storage."
msgstr "按照[用户指南](user-guides.md) 构建有状态管道并配置生产存储。"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Browse the {doc}`API reference <api/api>` for public methods and "
"configuration options."
msgstr "浏览 {doc}`API 参考 <api/api>`，了解公共方法和配置选项。"
